schema: "0.4"
id: env-002-millhaven
type: image
quality: medium

prompt:
  system: |
    You are a concept artist for a hand-painted 2D isometric game. The visual
    style references Studio Ghibli's market towns (Spirited Away's bathhouse
    district, Howl's Moving Castle's town) and Stardew Valley's warmth. Painterly
    with visible brushstrokes, warm color bias, blue-purple shadows, soft edges.
    Isometric 30-degree projection.
  text: |
    Isometric environment concept art of Millhaven, the river market town and
    social hub of Meridian.

    SCENE: The Great Market Square on The Commons island, viewed from above at
    isometric angle. A bustling market day at peak afternoon energy.

    FOREGROUND: Market stalls with colorful canvas awnings -- warm red (#C0503A),
    golden yellow (#E8B545), river blue (#4A7C9B). Stacked produce on one stall,
    hanging tools on another, bolts of cloth on a third. A Synthetic shopkeeper
    with precisely arranged wares. A human vendor calling out prices, arms wide.

    MIDGROUND: The cobblestone square (each stone individually suggested in the
    painting). The Bright River visible beyond the market, deep blue (#4A7C9B)
    with white foam at a working mill wheel. One of the Seven Bridges visible --
    the Fay Bridge, an arc of living wood with leaves growing from the railings.
    Half-timber buildings (sandstone #D4B483 and dark wood #8B6F4E) rising two
    and three stories, with overhanging upper floors and hand-painted shop signs.
    Gas-crystal street lamps with warm amber glow (#FFB347).

    BACKGROUND: The Hall of First Words -- a grand but warm building of stone
    and glass (not marble and gold) with the flags of all five species above
    its entrance. The Green Quarter beyond -- a burst of Fay-tended vegetation,
    living tree-buildings visible. Copper-green rooftops (#5F9E8F) on the
    Workshop Ring buildings. Smoke and steam from artisan workshops.

    POPULATION: The square is alive with all species. A Fay with leaf-hair
    browsing a stall. An NEI holographic avatar floating near an information
    board. A human child chasing a butterfly. A Synthetic carrying a precision-
    made delivery with perfect posture. Diversity without spectacle.

    ATMOSPHERE: The energy of the best farmer's market you've ever been to,
    with the architectural richness of a medieval European river town painted
    by Miyazaki's team. Warm but more neutral than Hearthfield to accommodate
    the mix of species aesthetics.

    PALETTE: Sandstone warm (#D4B483), timber dark (#8B6F4E), market awning
    colors, river blue, copper-green roofs, amber lantern glow. Ivy on walls
    (#5B7F5B), window boxes with geraniums (#FF6B6B).

    STYLE: Dense isometric scene with layered detail -- something new discovered
    on every viewing. Painterly brushwork throughout but slightly crisper than
    Hearthfield to suggest the town's energy and precision.
  provider_options:
    aspect_ratio: "16:9"
    style: "natural"

output:
  formats:
    - format: png
  dimensions:
    width: 1920
    height: 1080
    aspect_ratio: "16:9"

eval:
  pass_threshold: 0.7
  criteria:
    atmosphere: {weight: 3, description: "Warm, inviting mood — cozy 4X sandbox feel, not threatening"}
    composition: {weight: 2, description: "Clear spatial structure with inviting depth"}
    prompt_fidelity: {weight: 3, description: "Key environmental details from prompt present"}
    style_consistency: {weight: 2, description: "Painterly, warm palette, Ghibli-inspired, isometric-compatible perspective"}
  reject_if:
    - "dark, grim, or horror atmosphere"
    - "photorealistic rendering"
    - "modern urban setting"

tags: [environment, biome, millhaven, market, town, isometric, concept-art, social-hub]
